wed and given to the patient. The patient instructed to remove dressing in 24 hours, sleep with the surgical site elevated this evening, avoid alcohol, trauma and tobacco.\n Patient was informed to return in 2 Weeks for suture removal with Bree Parker PA-C.'}], 'has_procedure': False}
