2026-05-29 14:37:50.542 | INFO     | services.clinical_parser:extract_closure_sections:255 - ✅ Closure 1 → size=3.2, type=adjacent, group=high_risk
2026-05-29 14:37:50.542 | INFO     | services.clinical_parser:extract_closure_sections:255 - ✅ Closure 2 → size=3.2, type=adjacent, group=high_risk
